    "updated_at": "2026-01-21T16:09:01Z",
    "body": "Yes, correct. Though with #11560 you can have an `iframe` with the initial about:blank document, then change the `referrerpolicy` attribute, then navigate the `iframe`. The `Location` object is the same, but `ancestorOrigins` is different for the two documents. See https://wpt.fyi/results/html/browsers/history/the-location-interface/location-ancestor-origins-referrerpolicy-snapshot.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned",
